WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.660
Confidential Information.

2
00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:04.365
A coworker casually asks about information you saw

3
00:00:04.365 --> 00:00:08.127
in a record they are not working on. What do you do?

4
00:00:08.127 --> 00:00:08.986
A...

5
00:00:08.986 --> 00:00:11.900
Share it because they work for the same organization.

6
00:00:12.504 --> 00:00:13.189
B...

7
00:00:13.189 --> 00:00:17.113
Give only the interesting part without names. C...

8
00:00:17.113 --> 00:00:18.645
Do not disclose it and

9
00:00:18.645 --> 00:00:22.372
redirect the conversation appropriately. D...

10
00:00:22.372 --> 00:00:24.938
Ask why they want to know before deciding
